  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 220°C/200°C fan-forced.\n• Slice beetroot into thin wedges.\n• Place beetroot on a lined oven tray.\n• Drizzle with olive oil and season with salt. Toss to coat. Roast until tender, 30-35 minutes.\n• TIP: Beetroot stays firm when cooked. It’s done when you can pierce it with a fork.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67d83c9e18d6e477003fc9fb/step-7e876e00.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, grate carrot.\n• Finely chop garlic.\n• Slice lemon into wedges.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67d83c9e18d6e477003fc9fb/step-bf95f010.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a medium saucepan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat.\n• Add carrot and cook, stirring, until softened, 2-3 minutes. Add garlic and chermoula spice blend and cook until fragrant, 1 minute.\n• Add the water and bring to the boil. Add couscous, stir to combine. Cover with a lid and remove from heat.\n• Set aside until water is absorbed, 5 minutes.\n• Fluff up with a fork.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67d83c9e18d6e477003fc9fb/step-6ff2b120.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a small bowl, combine harissa paste, Greek-style yoghurt and a splash of water.\n• Season to taste with salt and pepper.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67d83c9e18d6e477003fc9fb/step-7f011830.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Once couscous is done, add spinach & rocket mix, flaked almonds, a squeeze of lemon juice and some marinated goat cheese oil (1 tbs for 2 people / 2 tbs for 4 people). Toss to combine.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67d83c9e18d6e477003fc9fb/step-167f7940.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide chermoula couscous salad between bowls. Top with roasted beetroot.\n• Drizzle over harissa yoghurt.\n• Crumble with goat cheese.\n• Serve with any remaining lemon wedges. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67d83c9e18d6e477003fc9fb/step-2d329750.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
